  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">`docs/standards/MODAL-DECISION-CRITERIA.md` has a "Component Layer" section pointing at `SprkModal`, `MODAL-DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`, ADR-050, and the size scale, with its existing decision-layer content unchanged.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Root `CLAUDE.md` §17 has exactly one new pointer row for `docs/standards/MODAL-DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`, placed beside the `MODAL-DECISION-CRITERIA.md` row; no other §17 rows changed.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`.claude/CHANGELOG.md` `[Unreleased]` has a new entry covering the FR-10 set (`MODAL-DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`, ADR-050, `modal-shell.md`, the cross-link + §17 row).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">`/conflict-check` was run before staging the root CLAUDE.md edit; any in-flight §17 conflict was reconciled at merge, not clobbered.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">No source code is modified (documentation only).</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>Design §5 (decision + component in lockstep) + spec FR-10. Root §18: every PR touching root CLAUDE.md or `.claude/` MUST add a CHANGELOG entry — this task carries the consolidated FR-10 entry so 011/012 don't each need their own. Precedent §17 row format: see the `MODAL-DECISION-CRITERIA.md` row already present in §17. Completion summary appended here when done.</notes>

